cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the fields below."
title: "Platform_Analysis_CoIP-MS-AP-MS"
abstract: >-
  A local platform (browser + Docker) for CoIP-MS / AP-MS analysis and
  identification of protein-protein interaction partners in the mouse proteome
  (Mus musculus, taxid 10090). It orchestrates published, peer-reviewed tools
  from the proteomics community (SAINTexpress, MiST, DEP/limma/MSstats, MaxQuant,
  FragPipe, DIA-NN) inside reproducible containers, with a dashboard served on
  localhost. It contains no experimental data.
type: software
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
